      "heading": "The day’s central witness",
      "id": "P002",
      "kind": "finding",
      "text": "Senate President Sherwin T. Gatchalian called the impeachment court to order before Presiding Officer Francis “Chiz” G. Escudero resumed the examination of Gina F. Acosta, the Office of the Vice President’s special disbursing officer for confidential funds. Her testimony about how the cash moved, and what records supported it, became the day’s central story."
