      "heading": "Four quarterly ₱125 million withdrawals",
      "id": "P003",
      "kind": "finding",
      "text": "Acosta described four quarterly withdrawals of 125 million pesos. She said the Vice President instructed her to release the encashed confidential funds to security officer Col. Lachica, who would implement the confidential activities. She said the final quarter of 2022 was released to him in full. In later quarters, the money could be released in several tranches. For one such quarter, she kept the balance in the office vault after an initial release and later released it based on Lachica’s fund-utilization report and object-of-expenditures request."
    },
