      "heading": "The internal handoff document",
      "id": "P004",
      "kind": "finding",
      "text": "For the handoff, Acosta said she used an internal Office of the Vice President document called an object of expenditures. It listed proposed expenses totaling 125 million pesos, was stamped “received,” and was signed by Lachica. She also said Lachica took that document back after she completed the liquidation. She said her liquidation, in turn, rested on documents he supplied after carrying out the confidential activities."
    },
