      "heading": "Reliance on Lachica’s records",
      "id": "P005",
      "kind": "finding",
      "text": "Acosta said she was not present for the ground operations and relied on Lachica’s statements and documents. The liquidation used acknowledgement receipts rather than official receipts. She noticed that some lacked dates or names. Senator-judge Raffy Tulfo raised records showing different purported informants with one signature. Acosta said she accepted Lachica’s explanation that the transactions were sensitive and confidential, and treated unusual recipient names as aliases."
    },
